# 6. Guard-chain contract

Global priority:

1. Initial `AuthContext` loading state.
2. If authenticated and `mustChangePassword`, allow only `/force-change-password`; route all other destinations there.
3. If merchant has no `business`, allow only `/business/setup` and force-change route.
4. Route authentication guard.
5. Route role guard.
6. Auth-route redirect guard.
7. Route content.

`RequireCustomer` and `RequireBusiness` must use the destination resolver, not unconditional `/`, when rejecting an authenticated but incompatible role.

