- Customer on `/login`, `/register`, `/register-business`, `/forgot-password`, `/forgot-password/verify`: resolve to customer default.
- Merchant without business on those routes: `/business/setup`.
- Merchant with business on those routes: `/`.
- OTP verification is allowed only while unauthenticated; a completed reset session is redirected to force-change.
- Avoid redirects while `AuthContext.loading`.

# 37. Business-setup handoff contract

- Family 1 directs authenticated merchant users with no `business` to `/business/setup`.
- Family 4 retains the business setup UI, API ownership, validation, and post-setup destination.
- Preserve current post-setup refresh and `/business/info` redirect until Family 4 changes it.
- Do not fold merchant setup fields into registration beyond current registration payload.

# 38. Registration/login success-state contract

- `/login?registered=1` shows one polite success status.
- Announce through `role="status"` / `aria-live="polite"`.
- Remove `registered` with `navigate(..., { replace: true })` after reading, so refresh/back does not repeat it.
- Dismissal is optional; if present, it is keyboard accessible and does not restore the query.
- Do not create backend success state.

# 39. Error-normalization architecture

```text
AuthErrorCategory =
  VALIDATION
  | INVALID_CREDENTIALS
  | DUPLICATE_IDENTITY
  | RATE_LIMITED
  | SESSION_EXPIRED
  | OTP_INVALID_OR_EXPIRED
  | NETWORK
  | SERVER
  | UNKNOWN
```

| Condition | Category | Safe copy |
|---|---|---|
| Login `401` | INVALID_CREDENTIALS | 使用者名稱或密碼不正確，請再試一次。 |
| Registration `400` duplicate message | DUPLICATE_IDENTITY | 無法使用此帳號資料，請調整後重試。 |
| `429` | RATE_LIMITED | 嘗試過於頻繁，請稍後再試。 |
| OTP `400` | OTP_INVALID_OR_EXPIRED | 驗證碼無效、已過期或無法再使用，請重新取得驗證碼。 |
| Authenticated `401` | SESSION_EXPIRED | 登入已逾時，請重新登入。 |
| Fetch failure | NETWORK | 無法連線，請確認網路後重試。 |
| `5xx` | SERVER | 系統暫時無法完成操作，請稍後再試。 |
| Other | UNKNOWN | 無法完成操作，請稍後再試。 |

# 40. Async/mutation architecture

Each route owns `idle | pending | success | error` state.

- Block duplicate submits while pending.
- Use abort/unmount protection before late state updates.
- Retain safe inputs on recoverable failure.
- Clear credentials, OTP, and password fields at security boundaries.
- Do not navigate on timers.
- Do not send Toast raw exception text.
- Refresh only after a session/identity change.

